WEBVTT

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.370
So the smelting is over already...

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:36.590
Activating... Activating... Activating... Activating...

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.180
All functions normal.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.020
Murakumo, activating.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.020
Ragna!

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.360
Did you come to kill me again?

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.820
Not to kill you.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.110
To dismantle you.

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.820
You and I were meant to be together, Ragna.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.910
Come, Ragna!

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:32.570
Damn.

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:40.120
You piece of...

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:43.290
I'm so happy.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.160
We're together now, Ragna.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:56.260
Just how many times has this happened, I wonder.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.310
The world keeps on turning.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.570
Everything goes round and round.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:15.280
We'll meet again in the never-changing conclusion.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:19.990
Sleep until then, Ragna the Bloodege.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.790
Rebel 1: The Red Rebel

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.550
This is the Akitsu Branch! The Novus Orbis Librarium Akitsu Branch!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:03:59.920
Report to HQ!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.300
It's the Grim Reaper! The Grim Reaper has appeared!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.010
He's single-handedly devastated our branch—

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.870
Looks like the seithr is thick around here.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:38.670
Damn!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.050
A good day to you, Ragna.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.550
But oh, how bored I am...

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:48.430
You bitch!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.480
My, my!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.520
Damn Rabbit! The hell was that for?!

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:03.900
Y-Y-Yeah! That was hella mean, Princess!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.530
You seem to be controlling it well.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:12.410
Knowing you for the fool you are, I thought you might have fallen prey to that Grimoire.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.870
I'm impressed.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.410
You're a good boy, Ragna.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.370
What the fuck do you want from me?!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.460
Go to Kagutsuchi.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:21.590
I what now?!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.720
Kagutsuchi?

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.630
What about that incomplete city?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:32.140
I guess I haven't destroyed the Cauldron in Kagutsuchi yet...

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.610
Guess I'll check it out.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.250
Hey, if it isn't the stinking vampire.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.500
Have you been watching again? You must have a lot of time to kill.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:05.050
Yeah. So much time I don't even know what to do with it.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:10.300
When things keep repeating over and over like this, I can't really make any plans, y'know.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:13.060
Behave yourself and stick to just observing.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.850
I appreciate the advice.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.640
But too bad!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:20.480
I've got all kinds of irons in the fire already!

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:40.790
Pardon me, sir.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.580
Second Lieutenant Noel Vermillion, sir.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.550
Enter.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.430
Major Kisaragi, this is for you sir.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.440
<i>It has an ars magus seal.</i>

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.030
<i>Must be a classified document.</i>

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:22.540
Ragna...

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.380
Ragna the Bloodedge...

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.970
Major... Kisaragi?

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.810
So it's Kagutsuchi?

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:48.860
Move aside.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.550
Lotsa people 'round here.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.190
Meat...

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.490
Meawt!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.780
Taokaka Punch!

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.410
Me-OW!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.420
Meowie...

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.300
She's from the Kaka clan!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:55.380
I need food...

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.510
I need it right meow...

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.140
Say your prayers, food!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.020
You're a real good guy, treating me-ow to all this food!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.900
You've got one hell of an appetite.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.440
I got a name. Call me Tao.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:18.320
By the way, Good Guy, do you meow where Rawrgna is?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.450
Huh?

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.660
"Rawrgna"?

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:24.620
I've gato pounce on this Rawrgna guy and collect the reward.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.790
It's the biggest bounty in hisstory!

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.420
<i>She's a bounty hunter?</i>

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.210
This is what Rawrgna looks like.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.760
<i>That doesn't look like me at all!</i>

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.340
If you see Rawrgna, tell me-ow!

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:37.970
Good Guy is a good guy,

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:41.850
so I'll treat you next time with the bounty money.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:47.310
<i>She doesn't have the slightest clue that I'm the Rawrgna she's looking for.</i>

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:49.480
I'm stuffed!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:55.820
Now that I'm all full, meowbe I'll take a little catnap.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.150
A nap?

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.530
Right-o!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:03.830
I love taking naps in the sunlight!

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:18.840
What's the matter?

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.180
Nothing at all.

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:22.640
You're already done?

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:23.850
There's still some left over!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.310
Furtunate fur me!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:35.980
<i>Incredible.</i>

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:37.940
<i>So this is what it feels like.</i>

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.610
Listen to me, Ragna.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.990
Do not assume the Azure Grimoire's power to be your own.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.830
Not ever.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.830
I know, Master.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.470
A gaze that trembles with hatred.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:05.220
With your loved ones killed and family stolen away, it is an emotion that is rightfully yours to feel.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.560
Even so, the world will turn.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:10.980
As it always has. No matter how you fight it.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:29.450
So this is the 13th Hiearchical City of Kagutsuchi.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:33.210
Well, well, feeling like a tourist, are we,

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.750
Second Lieutenant Noel Vermillion?

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:41.630
M-My apologies, Captain Hazama.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.430
Oh, please.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.760
Don't address me by rank, I beg you.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:50.890
I'm still technically a member of the Intelligence Department, y'know?

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:51.600
Yes, sir!

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.900
So, uh...

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.940
"Mr. Hazama" will do just fine.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.650
Okay, then. Let's review.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:04.490
Regarding the search for Major Jin Kisaragi,

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.280
it is currently being treated as a top secret matter.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:11.790
If it becomes known that the Hero of Ikaruga is AWOL,

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:15.630
it would hurt us in many ways.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:22.420
Therefore, in the event that you find him, take him into custody immediately and bring him in to HQ.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:23.130
Yes, sir!

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.470
This is your duty as the Major's secretary.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:36.100
Also, here in Kagutsuchi, a Level D alert is currently in effect.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:40.230
I take it it has to do with the appearance of the Grim Reaper, Ragna the Bloodedge,

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:43.360
who's attacked several of our branches in other Hierarchical Cities already.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.570
That's entirely right.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.910
Have your superiors said anything to you about this Grim Reaper?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:53.620
Oh. Yes, sir. I have been told to refrain from making contact and to limit myself to surveillance only.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.210
Roger that. In that case...

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:00.590
There's still some time left. Please go get a quick lay of the land.

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:03.050
We will meet up later at the Kagutsuchi Branch Office.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.630
Yes, sir! Then please excuse me, sir.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.990
So he's in that direction...

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.990
Meow, meow, meow, meow! Meow, meow, meow!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:30.280
Meow, meow, meow, meow, me—

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.620
Hey! Quit following me!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.960
I'm not following mew.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.120
Purrhaps I'm just heading in the same direction?

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:38.830
God...

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:46.470
Hey, Good Guy, you hid something just meow, didn't you? Show me-ow!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.260
Could it pawsibly be a meat bun?

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:50.350
Hey, cut it out!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.810
Don't touch my right arm!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.190
I feel like slinging the cat...

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.610
That's enough! You're getting on my nerves! Stay away from me!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.820
What's wrong, Good Guy?

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.990
Meow're you so mad?

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:18.000
I doubt anyone will come this way.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.170
You seem to be controlling it well.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:29.550
Do not assume the Azure Grimoire's power to be your own.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:35.220
Hah! So <i>this</i> counts as being in control?

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.250
What?

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.140
Get over here, Saya!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:43.580
Saya?!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:44.420
What?

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.090
You're not her!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.750
Who the hell are you?!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.050
Uh, um...

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.760
Are you feeling okay?

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.260
You were having a terrible nightmare.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.640
You're looking a bit pale.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.470
It doesn't seem like you have a fever.

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:02.440
Still, it might be good to have a real doctor take a look at you.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.310
What's wrong with your arm?!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:14.780
Wait!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:19.330
Gosh! He's always running off without warning!

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.880
Huh? "Always"?

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.130
But this is the first time we've met...

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.970
<i>What's up with this place?</i>

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.970
<i>Not a single soul.</i>

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:43.730
<i>A completely deserted NOL branch office?</i>

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.440
<i>A trap?</i>

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.150
Took you long enough.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.160
Finally, we meet.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.450
Brother.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:04.370
Jin, is that you?

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:08.210
I'm amazed you survived that wound.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.920
And that arm of yours...

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:13.170
The new one looks <i>much</i> sturdier than the old one.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.470
I may not even be able to cut it off with this anymore.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.260
You bastard!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:21.810
Jin!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:25.690
Oh, Brother! It really <i>is</i> you!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:29.480
You've got a hell of a lot of answering to do, buddy!

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:33.530
And my sword is first in line!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:37.280
Let's keep on killing each other over and over again, Brother!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:03.600
That really was something.

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:06.730
So this is the power of the Azure Grimoire.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.900
That's the spirit!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:11.360
I was just getting started!

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.400
Aren't you enjoying yourself, Brother?

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.280
Fuck, no!

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:22.240
Wha—

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.140
What's wrong, Brother?

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:52.020
Aren't you going to finish me off?

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:55.070
You think I came here for you?

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.190
I'm sure you can manage to die without my help.

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.610
You're too naive, Brother...

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.040
That's why you can't protect anything.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.580
Not anything.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:17.380
There's no one here?

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.800
Do you supposed it might be the work of Ragna the Bloodedge?

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:26.850
Oho?

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:29.770
Major Kisaragi!

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.980
Looks like he's... out cold.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:38.780
How convenient. This will make it easy to take him back.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.150
Mission accomplished.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:42.990
All right. Let's get outta here.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.160
Please wait!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:47.700
I will begin pursuit of Ragna the Bloodedge!

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:51.410
That so? I thought you were ordered to avoid contact?

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:52.670
Yes, I was.

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:56.090
But this situation is irregular.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.300
We cannot ignore it.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.760
I see.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.840
Well, I guess that's true.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.680
Mr. Hazama, please take care of the Major.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.760
<i>Given this situation,</i>

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.180
<i>we can't possibly ignore Ragna the Bloodedge.</i>

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.560
<i>What in the world is Captain Hazama thinking?</i>

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.460
God damn it!

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:37.500
<i>What's this?</i>

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:42.970
<i>The Azure Grimoire is afraid?</i>

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.390
At long last we meet again, O Dark One.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.900
Fear is the correct emotion here.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.400
Fear of the ultimate power.

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:00.650
Fear of death.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.190
To my knowledge,

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:07.160
not once have you emerged victorious.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.030
Hey, asshole.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.540
Who the hell are you?!

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.370
I am the one who will destroy you.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:14.330
Shit!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:18.960
I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just sword.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:24.550
With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this world and cleanse it in the fires of destruction.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.550
I am Hakumen.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.060
The end has come!

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:04.400
O Azure Grimoire, dwelling within my right arm,

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:07.860
erase the jinx on anime shows based on fighting games!

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:11.030
Rebel 2, "The Azure Successor".

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:16.040
Art by: Sumeragi
